---
title: Financial Literacy App for Young Adults - D2 Client App, Transaction Entry and Offline Queue
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Goal - help young adults budget, save and manage debt with simple tracking and AI coaching. Input - a transaction typed by the user. Output - a saved transaction (I2) or one queued on the device." as Info

    [*] --> Editing
    Editing --> Validating: Save pressed
    Validating --> Editing: check fails / show field messages (US-05)
    Validating --> Submitting: checks pass / POST /transactions with Idempotency-Key
    Submitting --> Saved: 201, or 200 already saved
    Submitting --> Editing: 400 or 404 / show field messages
    Submitting --> Queued: offline, timeout or 503 / store in pendingTransactions
    Queued --> Syncing: back online, app start, or every 60 s
    Syncing --> Saved: 201 or 200 / remove from queue
    Syncing --> Queued: offline or 503 / attempts + 1
    Syncing --> NeedsFix: 400 or 404 / notice tx-needs-fix
    NeedsFix --> Editing: user opens the entry
    Saved --> [*]

    state "Legend - rounded box = state; arrow = transition labelled 'event / action'; filled circle = start; ringed circle = end. 401 at any step triggers one token refresh and retry (Auth state machine)." as Legend
